Maintainer: Ricardo Branco <rbranco@suse.de>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13),
               bpftool,
               clang,
               libbpf-dev,
               llvm,
               make
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://github.com/ricardobranco777/bpf-lsm-progs
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: bpf-lsm-progs
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, make
Description: BPF LSM programs for Linux security policy enforcement
 Denies creation of legacy/niche socket address families and IP
 protocols with a history of local memory-safety bugs, denies mounting
 legacy/niche filesystem types, restricts unprivileged user namespace
 creation, and blocks setuid/setgid bit creation for non-root
 processes, all enforced via BPF LSM hooks.
